{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在屏幕上半部左侧的大号白色文字，字号最大、亮度最高、占据主要视野；右上角蓝色目录字较小，下半部金色音符动画相对暗，不构成主要文字入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个人心里仍憋着一股气，想起过去曾被人当作自己人。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、短暂高兴、心酸。\",\n  \"missed\": \"过去的日子已经回不去，以及离开以后是否真的会更好；后来从焦躁转为柔和、短暂轻松，却仍然没有答案；最终对自己是否真正相信产生怀疑。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块文字过长，一块里包含回忆、情绪变化、对未来的疑问以及后续音乐情绪的多层描述。\",\n    \"核心处境和感受虽然出现在开头，但两者的完整关系需要连续读过多个长句才能明确。\",\n    \"后半部分有多次情绪转折，第一眼难以判断哪些是当前核心，哪些是后续变化。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1ae1f211-205e-47f2-b2d2-7fe3088a8ae8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T015613265569Z", "elapsed_seconds": 28.938, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:56:42.214102+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1ddc2b71d79c4f8a964a77741bd79a47b3cfb89a90f560aafe38bc7d08cf267d", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc422230